}],"faq":[{"q":"When is the best time to visit Aspen / Snowmass?","a":"**Best time:** deep winter — Aspen Mountain & Snowmass opened **27 November 2025**; Aspen Mountain runs to **19 April 2026**, Snowmass and Highlands to ~**12 April 2026**; powder heart Jan–Mar.","source":"https://www.gosnowmass.com/things-to-do-5/ski-area/stats-dates/","accessed":"2026-07-18"},{"q":"How do I get to Aspen / Snowmass?","a":"**An in-town jet airport:** **Aspen/Pitkin County Airport (ASE)** sits ~**3 miles** from downtown at 7,820 ft — a rare in-valley commercial + private-jet gateway.","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aspen/Pitkin_County_Airport","accessed":"2026-07-18"},{"q":"What is worth doing in Aspen / Snowmass?","a":"Hike the Highland Bowl — a ~45-minute ridge hike to 12,392 ft and a 40-plus-degree in-bounds bowl — a rite of passage for serious skiers.","source":"https://www.aspensnowmass.com/discover/experiences/guides/everything-you-should-know-about-highland-bowl","accessed":"2026-07-18"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Aspen/Snowmass Ski Guide: Four Mountains, One Pass & America''s Ski Capital","meta_description":"Plan Aspen/Snowmass, Colorado - America''s ultra-luxury ski capital: four mountains on one Ikon pass (Aspen Mountain, Highlands'' Highland Bowl, Buttermilk''s X Games, Snowmass''s 4,406 ft vertical), a real 1880s silver-mining town, The Little Nell, Michelin-starred Bosq and real snowcat powder, with an in-town jet airport, real timing, altitude/avalanche safety and booking intel.","slug":"aspen-snowmass-colorado","primary_keyword":"Aspen Snowmass travel guide","long_tail":["Aspen Snowmass four mountains one pass","Highland Bowl hike-to guide","Aspen Mountain Powder Tours snowcat","The Little Nell ski-in ski-out","Winter X Games Aspen dates","fly private into Aspen ASE"],"search_language":"es-US","local_keywords":["guia de viaje Aspen Snowmass","cuatro montanas un pase Aspen","Highland Bowl Aspen","esqui de lujo en Aspen","The Little Nell","X Games Aspen"],"hreflang